    'Nucleus accumbens':'reward and motivation-related circuitry',
    'Anterior cingulate cortex':'decisions, autonomic/emotional responses and reward anticipation',
    'Posterior cingulate cortex':'memory and visual processing',
    'Frontal lobe':'planning, thought and voluntary movement',
    'Parietal lobe':'body sensation and spatial processing',
